| R13-8 | no result-payload goldens | Recorded decision: behavior contracts over goldens |

## Closure

Fixed in this round's commits: R13-5, R13-7 (each with fail-without-it
evidence — the dropped-oc canary variant fails on the pre-fix range
check; the restore test's content assertion fails on the pre-fix
(id,title) projection). Opened: D39, D40. Companion work already
landed: D35 (the defect), D36 (the flake it exposed), D37 (S8/ai1 +
consumer contracts). Live-backend legs unexecuted (URLs/tokens unset).
